## @file
# DvolPkg - UEFI Shell command and application for wiping MBR/GPT partitions.
#
# This package provides two ways to use the 'dvol' utility:
#   1. DvolApp.efi    - Standalone UEFI application. Run directly from the shell.
#   2. UefiShellDvolCommandsLib - Library for building 'dvol' into Shell.efi.
